<!doctype html>
<html lang="id">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><meta name="theme-color" content="#000000"><title>Pendaftaran diterima · Billing FIKSUM</title><link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet"><style>:root{color-scheme:dark}html,body{min-height:100%;background:#000!important;color:#f8f9fa}.card{--bs-card-bg:#101010;--bs-card-color:#f8f9fa;border-color:#2b2b2b}.form-control{background:#111;color:#fff;border-color:#444}.text-muted{color:#adb5bd!important}</style></head>
<body class="d-flex align-items-center" style="min-height:100vh"><main class="container py-4"><div class="row justify-content-center"><div class="col-lg-7"><div class="card"><div class="card-body p-4 p-md-5"><div class="text-success fs-1 mb-2">✓</div><h1 class="h3">Pendaftaran sudah masuk ke Billing</h1><p class="text-muted">Terima kasih, {{ $customer->name }}. Tim FIKSUM akan menghubungi WhatsApp {{ $customer->whatsapp_number }} untuk verifikasi area dan pemasangan.</p><div class="alert alert-warning">Status akun saat ini <strong>Uji coba / menunggu pemasangan</strong>. Internet belum aktif dan belum ada konfigurasi MikroTik yang dibuat.</div><h2 class="h5">Akses Portal Pelanggan</h2><p class="small text-muted">Simpan ID dan password ini. Password portal hanya ditampilkan kali ini.</p><div class="mb-3"><label class="form-label" for="customer_code">ID pelanggan</label><div class="input-group"><input id="customer_code" class="form-control" value="{{ $customer->customer_code }}" readonly><button class="btn btn-outline-light" type="button" data-copy="customer_code">Salin</button></div></div><div class="mb-3"><label class="form-label" for="portal_password">Password portal</label><div class="input-group"><input id="portal_password" class="form-control" value="{{ $portalPassword }}" readonly><button class="btn btn-outline-light" type="button" data-copy="portal_password">Salin</button></div></div><div class="mb-3"><span class="text-muted">Paket yang diajukan</span><div class="fw-semibold">{{ $customer->package?->name ?? '—' }} · Rp {{ number_format($customer->package?->price ?? 0,0,',','.') }}/bulan</div></div><a class="btn btn-primary w-100" href="{{ route('portal.login') }}">Buka Portal Pelanggan</a></div></div></div></div></main><script>document.querySelectorAll('[data-copy]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',async()=>{const input=document.getElementById(button.dataset.copy);try{await navigator.clipboard.writeText(input.value);button.textContent='Tersalin';}catch{input.select();document.execCommand('copy');button.textContent='Tersalin';}}));</script></body>
</html>

